Figure 4: Example Prompt for Ref-Long-A: Instructions Preceding Documents, where "88" is the interested key.

We fine-tune LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct using LLaMA-Factory (Zheng et al., 2024), setting the number of epochs to 1 and the learning rate to 1e-4. We adopt a LoRA strategy (Hu et al.) instead of training with full parameters, as we observe the latter method often leads to the model outputting the same answer for all test samples. Fine-tuning is performed on two NVIDIA A800 GPUs, taking roughly 15 minutes.Example Prompt (A) [User Input]:

